[h1]琉焰卿的永恒轮回：典造琉焰廷臣·白绮特供版[/h1]
[h2]Eternal Recurrence: Glassfire Courtier Creator - Vivhite Edition[/h2]

[b]只保留一笔交易：用游戏内金币，典造一名真正属于你宫廷的自定义廷臣。[/b]
[b]One transaction, standing alone: spend in-game gold to commission a custom courtier for your court.[/b]

Version 1.0.1 · CK3 1.19.0.6 · Workshop 3787304042

[h1]独立版 / Standalone[/h1]

不需要安装【琉焰卿的永恒轮回】原版。本 mod 不包含轮回、死亡计分、契约、祝福诅咒、商店、账簿、教程记录、事件或游戏规则。
The original Eternal Recurrence mod is not required. This edition contains no recurrence, death scoring, contracts, blessings/curses, shop, ledger, tutorial persistence, events, or game rules.

两者也可同时启用。独立版使用完整隔离的脚本、GUI、状态与资源命名空间，并已在两种加载顺序下通过 CK3 1.19.0.6 实机验收。
Both mods may also be enabled together. The standalone edition uses isolated script, GUI, state, and asset namespaces and has passed real-engine acceptance in both load orders on CK3 1.19.0.6.

[h1]典造内容 / What You Can Commission[/h1]

[list]
[*]0–120 岁精确年龄与六项 0–100 基础能力 / Exact age 0–120 and six base skills from 0–100
[*]25 项教育、17 项将才、38 项身体、36 项性格与 108 项其他原生特质 / 25 education, 17 commander, 38 physical, 36 personality, and 108 other native traits
[*]所有已载入文化与信仰 / Every loaded culture and faith
[*]出身卑微，或归入玩家宗族与家族 / Lowborn, or membership in the player's dynasty and house
[*]关窗重开保留本次配置 / Close and reopen without losing the current configuration
[/list]

价码沿用原生统治者设计器的非线性能力与特质曲线。只有廷臣创建并成功交付后才扣除一次游戏内金币；取消、金币不足或交付失败都不会收费。
Prices follow the vanilla Ruler Designer's nonlinear skill and trait curves. In-game gold is charged exactly once and only after successful creation and delivery; canceling, insufficient funds, or failed delivery costs nothing.

[b]“付费”只指 CK3 游戏内金币，不涉及现实货币。[/b]
[b]“Paid” refers only to CK3 in-game gold. No real-money purchase is involved.[/b]

[h1]使用方法 / How To Use[/h1]

进入任意在世人类玩家角色的决议面板，打开【典造琉焰廷臣·白绮特供版】，在七页契页中完成配置并封缄典造。AI 没有入口。
As any living human player, open Decisions and choose “Commission a Glassfire Courtier.” Configure the seven tabs, then seal the commission. AI characters have no entry point.

