[h1]本地化 / Localization[/h1]

简中 / English / Français / Deutsch / 日本語 / 한국어 / Polski / Русский / Español

[h1]兼容性 / Compatibility[/h1]

实测基线为 CK3 1.19.0.6，推荐新开局与单机。独立版不注册 on_action、事件或游戏规则，也不覆盖原版文件；其他 mod 若定义同名键或改写相同原生界面依赖，仍不作保证。
Tested on CK3 1.19.0.6. New single-player games are recommended. This edition registers no on_actions, events, or game rules and replaces no vanilla files; compatibility with mods defining the same keys or altering the same native UI dependencies is not guaranteed.

